  "brief": "THE CASE IN FIVE LINES\n1. Colleen Okafor, 53, second-shift dye-house superintendent at Millbrook Woven Goods Plant #2, was found unresponsive in the mezzanine dye-house office on 2016-04-17; manner is homicide from blunt force head injury (doc01, doc02).\n2. Medical Examiner set the wide window at 22:30–00:30 (doc02), while Colleen Okafor's 23:46 outgoing SMS (doc10) and 23:53 PIN 2261 unlock (doc05) narrow the survival floor to 23:53–00:30.\n3. Yvonne Thorne gave a false Year-1 alibi (doc07) refuted by 22:56–23:18 ALPR crossings (doc09), but his 23:18 northbound exit and 23:36 cardlock swipe 16.2 miles away precede Colleen Okafor's 23:46 SMS, corroborating his absence during the narrowed window.\n4. Helena Pelletier's departure account shows medium 6-year drift (doc12 vs. doc13), and the press rumor regarding the defective latch is neutralized by 2015 public inspection docket doc16.\n5. Master PIN 9088 (assigned to Ruben Solis) unlocked the mezzanine dye-house office at 00:07 (doc05) and circuit load ran until 00:19 (doc11), while CSI notes a 2-vs-1 marker 5 discrepancy, an uncollected 23:39 photo, and an unpulled exterior camera.\n\nSTRONGEST CONTRADICTION\nRuben Solis's denial of unlocking or entering the mezzanine dye-house office conflicts with the keypad export:\n- doc03: \"I never entered the mezzanine dye-house office at any point that night. On my rounds I only check the exterior handle from the corridor.\"\n- doc05: \"2016-04-17 00:07 — PIN 9088 UNLOCK\" (paired with doc05 PIN schedule assigning 9088 to Ruben Solis, and doc11 load drop at 00:19).\n\nALIBI TABLE (Narrowed survival window 23:53–00:30 (within ME window 22:30–00:30))\n- Ruben Solis: CONTRADICTED\n- Yvonne Thorne: CORROBORATED (cleared of narrowed window by doc09 + doc10)\n- Helena Pelletier: UNCORROBORATED (MEDIUM multi-year drift, doc12 vs. doc13)\n- Clarissa Medina: UNCORROBORATED (22:48 entry confirmed by doc05; no exit log)\n\nTOP THREE LEADS\n1. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Ruben Solis in person and ask why master PIN 9088 unlocked the mezzanine dye-house office strike at 00:07 (doc05) while doc03 denies entering and doc04 logs only a corridor handle check.\n2. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Ruben Solis in person regarding the high-severity contradiction between his 23:00 dark-office claim (doc03) and the AMI sub-meter load continuing until 00:19 (doc11).\n3. (60 pts, 25 + 20 + 15 = 60) Submit preserved biological trace swab Item 3 from Property Clerk ledger doc15 to the state forensic laboratory for STR and touch-DNA testing.\n\nGAP LIST\n- Marker 5 count discrepancy: two crimped lead bale-lot seals observed in scene report but only one booked in Property Clerk ledger.\n- Original digital file and EXIF metadata for the 23:39 patron photograph were never collected or booked.\n- Exterior municipal/commercial camera facing the property was never pulled.\n- Preserved biological swab Item 3 remains sealed and untested for STR/touch DNA.\n\nThis board judges the file. The detective does the detecting."
