  "brief": "THE CASE IN FIVE LINES\n1. Hanna Alvarez, 54, night-audit general manager at Parkway Rest Motor Court, was found unresponsive in the registration night-audit office on 2016-07-23; manner is homicide from two penetrating 9mm gunshot wounds to the chest (doc01, doc02).\n2. Medical Examiner set the wide window at 22:32–00:32 (doc02), while Hanna Alvarez's 23:48 outgoing SMS (doc10) and 23:55 PIN 3036 unlock (doc05) narrow the survival floor to 23:55–00:32.\n3. Alicia Ullman gave a false Year-1 alibi (doc07) refuted by 22:58–23:20 ALPR crossings (doc09), but his 23:20 northbound exit and 23:38 cardlock swipe 16.2 miles away precede Hanna Alvarez's 23:48 SMS, corroborating his absence during the narrowed window.\n4. Vera Zimmerman's departure account shows medium 6-year drift (doc12 vs. doc13), and the press rumor regarding the defective latch is neutralized by 2015 public inspection docket doc16.\n5. Master PIN 9078 (assigned to Vera Pelletier) unlocked the registration night-audit office at 00:09 (doc05) and circuit load ran until 00:21 (doc11), while CSI notes a 2-vs-1 marker 5 discrepancy, an uncollected 23:41 photo, and an unpulled exterior camera.\n\nSTRONGEST CONTRADICTION\nVera Pelletier's denial of unlocking or entering the registration night-audit office conflicts with the keypad export:\n- doc03: \"I never entered the registration night-audit office at any point that night. On my rounds I only check the exterior handle from the corridor.\"\n- doc05: \"2016-07-23 00:09 — PIN 9078 UNLOCK\" (paired with doc05 PIN schedule assigning 9078 to Vera Pelletier, and doc11 load drop at 00:21).\n\nALIBI TABLE (Narrowed survival window 23:55–00:32 (within ME window 22:32–00:32))\n- Vera Pelletier: CONTRADICTED\n- Alicia Ullman: CORROBORATED (cleared of narrowed window by doc09 + doc10)\n- Vera Zimmerman: UNCORROBORATED (MEDIUM multi-year drift, doc12 vs. doc13)\n- Roman Kowalski: UNCORROBORATED (22:50 entry confirmed by doc05; no exit log)\n\nTOP THREE LEADS\n1. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Vera Pelletier in person and ask why master PIN 9078 unlocked the registration night-audit office strike at 00:09 (doc05) while doc03 denies entering and doc04 logs only a corridor handle check.\n2. (80 pts, 40 + 25 + 15 = 80) Have the detective re-interview Vera Pelletier in person regarding the high-severity contradiction between his 23:00 dark-office claim (doc03) and the AMI sub-meter load continuing until 00:21 (doc11).\n3. (60 pts, 25 + 20 + 15 = 60) Submit preserved biological trace swab Item 3 from Property Clerk ledger doc15 to the state forensic laboratory for STR and touch-DNA testing.\n\nGAP LIST\n- Marker 5 count discrepancy: two spent 9mm brass shell casings observed in scene report but only one booked in Property Clerk ledger.\n- Original digital file and EXIF metadata for the 23:41 patron photograph were never collected or booked.\n- Exterior municipal/commercial camera facing the property was never pulled.\n- Preserved biological swab Item 3 remains sealed and untested for STR/touch DNA.\n\nThis board judges the file. The detective does the detecting."
